================================================================================
Protocols and specifications
================================================================================

The turn-event vocabulary in src/lib/acp.ts is a hand-written subset of the
Agent Client Protocol (https://agentclientprotocol.com). The
@agentclientprotocol/sdk package is a devDependency used only to type-check that
subset (src/lib/acpConformance.ts); no SDK code is bundled or redistributed.


