production dependency tree is predominantly MIT and ISC.

To regenerate a current inventory:

    pnpm licenses list --prod

Measured across the production tree (218 packages) at the time of writing:

    MIT                                  190
    ISC                                   14
    BSD-3-Clause                           4
    Apache-2.0                             3
