================================================================================
Coding-agent CLIs
================================================================================

Open Run invokes coding-agent CLIs (claude, codex, grok, gemini) as child
processes. Those programs are separate works, distributed under their own terms
by their own vendors, and are neither bundled with nor derived from this
program. Invoking a separate program at arm's length over a pipe does not make
it part of this work. You must obtain and be licensed for those CLIs yourself.
